      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Alt-F4 squad! \nJokes aside, I've been in worlds where the respawn glitched, dropping me beneath the world and forcing me to take off my HMD and force-exit the client. As someone who gets very immersed into the VR world, this can be quite a nuisance, and with the social aspect of the game (I was doing a puzzle map with friends, and most of us had the same glitch), it's doubly important to me to not have to exit the game even due to bugs.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
